We assessed the spatial dependencies among spots using Moran’s I statistics. This analysis discerns whether gene expression patterns across the sample are spatially clustered, randomly distributed or dispersed. Moran’s I is indicative of spatial clustering when positive and spatial dispersion when negative. Moran’s I index is given by the following formula:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
