				\begin{document}$${\rm{SCI}}=\frac{N}{2\mathop{\sum }\nolimits_{i}^{N}\mathop{\sum }\nolimits_{j}^{N}{W}_{{ij}}}\frac{\mathop{\sum }\nolimits_{i}^{N}\mathop{\sum }\nolimits_{j}^{N}{W}_{{ij}}\left({x}_{i}-\bar{x}\right)\left({y}_{j}-\bar{y}\right)}{\sqrt{\mathop{\sum }\nolimits_{i}^{N}{\left({x}_{i}-\bar{x}\right)}^{2}}\sqrt{\mathop{\sum }\nolimits_{j}^{N}{\left({y}_{j}-\bar{y}\right)}^{2}}},$$\end{document}SCI=N2∑iN∑jNWij∑iN∑jNWijxi−x¯yj−ȳ∑iNxi−x¯2∑jNyj−ȳ2,where xi and yj represent the levels of two different features and \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
